WEBVTT

00:09:26.407 --> 00:09:30.164
♪ And I would be a joker ♪ 
(Dan aku ingin menjadi Joker)

00:09:30.164 --> 00:09:34.304
♪ but that card looks silly ♪ 
(tapi kartu itu terlihat konyol)

00:09:34.304 --> 00:09:38.444
♪ when you play ♪
(ketika kamu memainkan)

00:09:38.444 --> 00:09:42.584
♪ your ace ♪ 
(kartu As-mu)

00:09:55.701 --> 00:09:59.469
♪ I'd like to know ♪ 
(Aku ingin tahu)

00:09:59.469 --> 00:10:03.238
♪ Are there stars in hell ♪ 
(Apakah ada bintang di neraka)